{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself aboard an experimental space station that has suddenly malfunctioned.<br>Your mission is to uncover the cause of the catastrophe, restore control of the station, and return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the path to the control center will be deadly:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the corridors, terrifying creatures escaped from test tubes and capsules are waiting for you;<br>the malfunctioning helper robots have turned into ruthless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solve puzzles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >search for tools to repair the station\u2019s systems and move further;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore the environment and find safe paths;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >encounter horrifying creatures and robots \u2014 with some it\u2019s better to fight or lure them into traps, while from others it\u2019s wiser to hide in time and run away.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you\u2019ll have to act lightning-fast:<br>make decisions on the move, use agility and ingenuity, and most importantly \u2014 remain unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be stealthy. Be invisible.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048200?t=1774883931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048200?t=1774883931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048200/5a75b9bd8fdaa44cdb144c8099223484ef5aa726/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774883931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048200/5a75b9bd8fdaa44cdb144c8099223484ef5aa726/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774883931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself aboard an experimental space station that has suddenly malfunctioned.<br>Your mission is to uncover the cause of the catastrophe, restore control of the station, and return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the path to the control center will be deadly:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the corridors, terrifying creatures escaped from test tubes and capsules are waiting for you;<br>the malfunctioning helper robots have turned into ruthless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solve puzzles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >search for tools to repair the station\u2019s systems and move further;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore the environment and find safe paths;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >encounter horrifying creatures and robots \u2014 with some it\u2019s better to fight or lure them into traps, while from others it\u2019s wiser to hide in time and run away.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you\u2019ll have to act lightning-fast:<br>make decisions on the move, use agility and ingenuity, and most importantly \u2014 remain unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be stealthy. Be invisible.</strong></p>","developers":["Artflux_Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048200/8edc5f2da993c333cc5251d30e114f0f3d9e0bd5/header.jpg?t=1774883931","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048200/745389029/73ffc80a36754f0b00f1b983058dde7b177d0572/1774876319/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774877057","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048200/745389029/73ffc80a36754f0b00f1b983058dde7b177d0572/1774876319/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774877057","h